1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We're [team name].

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
1971: Apollo 14's moonwalkers turned back
an estimated 50 to 75 m short of Cone Crater's rim.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ARIADNE: a thread home on Mars.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
NASA terrain, Curiosity's path and radiation data
become a meter-scale walk plan.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Rehearse it in 3D past real Curiosity photos,
then follow it on a four-item visor.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
May 20, 2024: a solar storm reached Mars in tens of minutes.
ARIADNE sends both walkers to the rover.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Every step keeps a way home.
